<title>SOUTH AFRICA: St Helena Dec qtr pre-capex net up.</title>
<headline>St Helena Dec qtr pre-capex net up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending  9.30 vs 7.21</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  0.27 vs 0.58</p>
<p>Full name: St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd  </p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			1,400  vs 1,168</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	     212,000  vs 192,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    6.6  vs 6.1</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 45,887  vs 51,180</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    55,873  vs 55,174</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the number 3, 4 and 5 Mills were stopped as part of the rationalisation of the overhead cost structure. None of the gold recovered from these mills has been included in the results.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
